```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Caller
    participant Contract as DoubleFinancingPreventer
    participant State as assets mapping
    participant FileStore as assetFiles mapping

    Caller->>Contract: registerFile(assetId, fileURI, fileHash)
    Contract->>Contract: require(assets[assetId].owner != address(0))
    Contract->>Contract: require(assets[assetId].owner == Caller)

    Contract->>FileStore: assetFiles[assetId] = FileRecord({ fileURI, fileHash, timestamp: block.timestamp })
    Contract-->>Caller: FileRegistered(assetId, fileHash, fileURI)

    Note over Caller,FileStore: fileHash = SHA-256 of the physical file<br/>fileURI = IPFS CID (e.g. ipfs://Qm.../file.pdf)
```